# Rules (notation 1). One per line: NAME, blanks, then the definition.
# '## text' lines are headings shown in the program's lists.

##                          CHAPTER I
##                   SENTENTIAL LOGIC
## Repetition
R          P.:P
## Double Negation
DNE        ~~P.:P
DNI        P.:~~P
##  
DN         DNE.DNI
## Modus Ponens
MP         P.P->Q.:Q
## Modus Tollens
MT         ~Q.P->Q.:~P
##  
##                          CHAPTER II
## Simplification
SL         P&Q.:P
SR         P&Q.:Q
##  
S          SL.SR
## Adjunction
Adj        P.Q.:P&Q
## Addition
AddR       P.:P|Q
AddL       P.:Q|P
##  
Add        AddL.AddR
## Modus Tollendo Ponens
MTPR       ~Q.P|Q.:P
MTPL       ~P.P|Q.:Q
##  
MTP        MTPR.MTPL
## Biconditional-Conditional
BCL        P<->Q.:P->Q
BCR        P<->Q.:Q->P
##  
BC         BCL.BCR
## Conditional-Biconditional
CB         P->Q.Q->P.:P<->Q
##                      DERIVED RULES
## Material Conditional
## T2
MC1        Q.:P->Q
## T18
MC2        ~P.:P->Q
## 
MC         MC1.MC2
## Separation of Cases
# To enable SC1, prove T33 (Ex95 T33).
## T33
SC1        P->Q.~P->Q.:Q
# To enable SC2, prove T49 (Ex107 T49).
## T49
SC2        P|Q.P->R.Q->R.:R
## Deriv 2.049a
SC2a       P|Q|S.P->R.Q->R.S->R.:R
##  Deriv 2.049b
SC2b       P|Q|S|T.P->R.Q->R.S->R.T->R.:R
# To enable SC3, prove T50 (Ex107a T50).
## T50
SC3        P->R.Q->R.:P|Q->R
##  
SC         SC1.SC2.SC2a.SC2b.SC3
## Conditional Disjunction
# To enable CDJ1 & CDJ3, prove T45 (Ex104 T45).
## T45
CDJ1       ~P->Q.:P|Q
CDJ3       P|Q.:~P->Q
# To enable CDJ2 & CDJ4, prove T46 (Ex105 T46).
## T46
CDJ2       ~P|Q.:P->Q
CDJ4       P->Q.:~P|Q
##  
CDJ        CDJ1.CDJ2.CDJ3.CDJ4
## Transposition 
# To enable TRANS1 & TRANS2, prove T111 (Ex127o T111).
## T111
TRANS1     (P->Q).:(~Q->~P)
TRANS2     (~Q->~P).:(P->Q)
##  
TRANS      TRANS1.TRANS2
## Conjunction Biconditional
# To enable CJB1, prove T84 (Ex123 T84).
## T84
CJB1       P&Q.:P<->Q
# To enable CJB2, prove T85 (Ex124 T85).
## T85
CJB2       ~P&~Q.:P<->Q
## T83
CJB3       P<->Q.:(P&Q)|(~P&~Q)
CJB4       (P&Q)|(~P&~Q).:P<->Q
##  
CJB        CJB1.CJB2.CJB3.CJB4
## Biconditional Expansion
## T81
BEX1       P<->Q.:(P->Q)&(Q->P)
BEX2       (P->Q)&(Q->P).:P<->Q
## Deriv 2.081a
BEX3       P<->Q.:(~P|Q)&(~Q|P)
BEX4       (~P|Q)&(~Q|P).:P<->Q
## T83
BEX5       P<->Q.:(P&Q)|(~P&~Q)
BEX6       (P&Q)|(~P&~Q).:P<->Q
##  
BEX        BEX1.BEX2.BEX3.BEX4.BEX5.BEX6
## Negation of a Conditional
# To enable NC1 & NC2, prove T40 (Ex101 T40).
## T40
NC1        ~(P->Q).:P&~Q
# To enable NC2, prove T42 (Ex101b T42).
# This is an alternative to T40. 
NC2        P&~Q.:~(P->Q)
##  
NC         NC1.NC2
## Negation of a Biconditional
# To enable NB1 & NB2, prove T90 (Ex126 T90).
## T90
NB1        ~(P<->Q).:P<->~Q
NB2        P<->~Q.:~(P<->Q)
##  
NB         NB1.NB2
## DeMorgan Laws
# To enable DM1 & DM3, prove T65 (Ex119 T65).
## T65
DM1        ~(P&Q).:~P|~Q
DM3        ~P|~Q.:~(P&Q)
# To enable DM2 & DM4, prove T66 (Ex120 T66).
## T66
DM2        ~(P|Q).:~P&~Q
# To enable DM4, prove T67 (Ex121 T67).
# This is an alternative to T66.
DM4        ~P&~Q.:~(P|Q)
# To enable DM5 & DM6, prove T63 (Ex117 T63).
## T63
DM5        P&Q.:~(~P|~Q)
DM6        ~(~P|~Q).:P&Q
# To enable DM7 & DM8, prove T64 (Ex118 T64).
## T64
DM7        P|Q.:~(~P&~Q)
DM8        ~(~P&~Q).:P|Q
##  
DM         DM1.DM2.DM3.DM4.DM5.DM6.DM7.DM8
## Negation of a Conjunct
# To enable NCJ1 & NCJ2, prove T43 & T44  (Ex2.043 T43 & Ex2.044 T44).
## T43
NCJ1       ~P.:~(P&Q)
## T44
NCJ2       ~Q.:~(P&Q)
##  
NCJ        NCJ1.NCJ2
## Distribution Laws
# To enable DIST1 & DIST2, prove T61 (Deriv 2.061 T61).
## T61
DIST1      P&(Q|R).:(P&Q)|(P&R)
DIST2      (P&Q)|(P&R).:P&(Q|R)
# To enable DIST5 & DIST6, prove Deriv 2.061a.
##  Deriv 2.061a
DIST5      (Q|R)&P.:(Q&P)|(R&P)
DIST6      (Q&P)|(R&P).:(Q|R)&P
# To enable DIST3 & DIST4, prove T62 (Deriv 2.062 T62).
## T62
DIST3      P|(Q&R).:(P|Q)&(P|R)
DIST4      (P|Q)&(P|R).:P|(Q&R)
# To enable DIST7 & DIST8, prove Deriv 2.062a.
## Deriv 2.062a
DIST7      (Q&R)|P.:(Q|P)&(R|P)
DIST8      (Q|P)&(R|P).:(Q&R)|P
## T116
DIST9      (P&Q)|(R&S).:(P|R)&(P|S)&(Q|R)&(Q|S)
DIST10     (P|R)&(P|S)&(Q|R)&(Q|S).:(P&Q)|(R&S)
## T117
DIST11     (P|Q)&(R|S).:(P&R)|(P&S)|(Q&R)|(Q&S)
DIST12     (P&R)|(P&S)|(Q&R)|(Q&S).:(P|Q)&(R|S)
##  
DIST       DIST1.DIST2.DIST3.DIST4.DIST5.DIST6.DIST7.DIST8.DIST9.DIST10.DIST11.DIST12
## Commutativity Laws
# To enable COM1, prove T24 (Ex89 T24).
## T24
COM1       P&Q.:Q&P
# To enable COM2, prove T53 (Ex109 T53).
## T53
COM2       P|Q.:Q|P
# To enable COM3, prove T92 (Ex126b T92).
## T92
COM3       P<->Q.:Q<->P
##  
COM        COM1.COM2.COM3
## Associativity Laws
# To enable ASSOC1 & ASSOC2, prove T25 (Ex90 T25).
## T25
ASSOC1     P&(Q&R).:(P&Q)&R
ASSOC2     (P&Q)&R.:P&(Q&R)
# To enable ASSOC3 & ASSOC4, prove T54 (Ex110 T54).
## T54
ASSOC3     P|(Q|R).:(P|Q)|R
ASSOC4     (P|Q)|R.:P|(Q|R)
# To enable ASSOC5 & ASSOC6, prove T94 (Ex126d T94).
## T94
ASSOC5     P<->(Q<->R).:(P<->Q)<->R
ASSOC6     (P<->Q)<->R.:P<->(Q<->R)
##  
ASSOC      ASSOC1.ASSOC2.ASSOC3.ASSOC4.ASSOC5.ASSOC6
## Exportation/Importation Laws
# To enable EXP1 & EXP2, prove T27 (Ex91 T27).
## T27
EXP1       (P&Q->R).:(P->(Q->R))
EXP2       (P->(Q->R)).:(P&Q->R)
##  
EXP        EXP1.EXP2
## Biconditional Tollens
## T76 & T77
BT1        (P<->Q).~P.:~Q
BT2        (P<->Q).~Q.:~P
##  
BT         BT1.BT2
## Biconditional Ponens
## T74 & T75
BP1        (P<->Q).P.:Q
BP2        (P<->Q).Q.:P
##  
BP         BP1.BP2.BT1.BT2
## Sentential Simplification Laws
## T70
SSimp1     Q.:(P&Q<->P)
SSimp2     Q.:(Q&P<->P)
## T71
SSimp3     ~Q.:(P|Q<->P)
SSimp4     ~Q.:(Q|P<->P)
## T2
SSimp5     P.:((P->Q)<->Q)
## T18
SSimp6     ~Q.:((P->Q)<->~P)
## T84
SSimp7     P.:((P<->Q)<->Q)
SSimp8     Q.:((P<->Q)<->P)
## T85
SSimp9     ~P.:((P<->Q)<->~Q)
SSimp10    ~Q.:((P<->Q)<->~P)
## T72
SSimp11    P->Q.:(P&Q<->P)
SSimp12    P->Q.:(Q&P<->P)
## T73
SSimp13    P->Q.:(P|Q<->Q)
SSimp14    P->Q.:(Q|P<->Q)
## T81
SSimp15    P->Q.:((P<->Q)<->(Q->P))
SSimp16    Q->P.:((P<->Q)<->(P->Q))
## T41
SSimp17    P&P.:P
SSimp18    P.:P&P
## T47
SSimp19    P|P.:P
SSimp20    P.:P|P
## T119
SSimp21    P&(Q|~Q).:P
SSimp22    P.:P&(Q|~Q)
## T120
SSimp23    P|(Q&~Q).:P
SSimp24    P.:P|(Q&~Q)
## T123
SSimp25    P|(P&Q).:P
SSimp26    P.:P|(P&Q)
## T124
SSimp27    P&(P|Q).:P
SSimp28    P.:P&(P|Q)
## 
SSimp      SSimp1.SSimp2.SSimp3.SSimp4.SSimp5.SSimp6.SSimp7.SSimp8.SSimp9.SSimp10.SSimp11.SSimp12.SSimp13.SSimp14.SSimp15.SSimp16.SSimp17.SSimp18.SSimp19.SSimp20.SSimp21.SSimp22.SSimp23.SSimp24.SSimp25.SSimp26.SSimp27.SSimp28
##  
##                          CHAPTER III
##            MONADIC PREDICATE LOGIC
## Universal Instantiation
UI         forall x Fx .: FA
## Existential Instantiation
EI         exists x Fx .: Fa
## Existential Generalization
EG         FA .: exists x Fx
##                      DERIVED RULES
## Quantifier Negation Laws
# To enable QN1 & QN2, prove T203 (Ex163c T203).
## T203
QN1        ~forall x Fx .: exists x ~Fx
QN2        exists x ~Fx .: ~forall x Fx
## T204
# To enable QN3 & QN4, prove T204 (Ex163d T204).
QN3        ~exists x Fx .: forall x ~Fx
QN4        forall x ~Fx .: ~exists x Fx
# To enable QN5 & QN6, prove T205 (Ex163e T205).
## T205
QN5        forall x Fx.:~exists x ~Fx
QN6        ~exists x ~Fx.:forall x Fx
# To enable QN7 & QN8, prove T206 (Ex164 T206).
## T206
QN7        exists x Fx.:~forall x ~Fx
QN8        ~forall x ~Fx.:exists x Fx
##  
QN         QN1.QN2.QN3.QN4.QN5.QN6.QN7.QN8
## Alphabetic Variance
# To enable AV1, prove T231 (Ex169r T231).
## T231
AV1        forall x Fx .: forall y Fy
# To enable AV2, prove T232 (Ex169s T232).
## T232
AV2        exists x Fx .: exists y Fy
## T405
AV3        G%xFx .: G%yFy
##  
AV         AV1.AV2.AV3
## Quantifier Distribution Laws
# To enable QDISTUA1 & QDISTUA2, prove T208 (Ex164d T208).
## T208
QDISTUA1   forall x (Fx&Gx).:forall x Fx&forall x Gx
QDISTUA2   forall x Fx&forall x Gx.:forall x (Fx&Gx)
##  
QDISTUA1a  forall x (Fx&Gx&Hx).:forall x Fx&forall x Gx&forall x Hx
QDISTUA2a  forall x Fx&forall x Gx&forall x Hx.:forall x (Fx&Gx&Hx)
##  
QDISTUA1b  forall x (Fx&Gx&Hx&Jx).:forall x Fx&forall x Gx&forall x Hx&forall x Jx
QDISTUA2b  forall x Fx&forall x Gx&forall x Hx&forall x Jx.:forall x (Fx&Gx&Hx&Jx)
# To enable QDISTEO1 & QDISTEO2, prove T207 (Ex164c T207).
## T207
QDISTEO1   exists x (Fx|Gx).:exists x Fx|exists x Gx
QDISTEO2   exists x Fx|exists x Gx.:exists x (Fx|Gx)
##  
QDISTEO1a  exists x (Fx|Gx|Hx).:exists x Fx|exists x Gx|exists x Hx
QDISTEO2a  exists x Fx|exists x Gx|exists x Hx.: exists x (Fx|Gx|Hx)
##  
QDISTEO1b  exists x (Fx|Gx|Hx|Jx).:exists x Fx|exists x Gx|exists x Hx|exists x Jx
QDISTEO2b  exists x Fx|exists x Gx|exists x Hx|exists x Jx.: exists x (Fx|Gx|Hx|Jx)
## The following quantifier distribution laws
## hold in only one direction.
# To enable QDISTUC, prove T201 (Ex163a T201).
## T201
QDISTUC    forall x (Fx->Gx).:(forall x Fx->forall x Gx)
# To enable QDISTUEC, prove T202 (Ex163b T202).
## T202
QDISTUEC   forall x (Fx->Gx).:(exists x Fx->exists x Gx)
# To enable QDISTUB, prove T213 (Ex169 T213).
## T213
QDISTUB    forall x (Fx<->Gx).:(forall x Fx<->forall x Gx)
# To enable QDISTUEB, prove T214 (Ex169a T214).
## T214
QDISTUEB   forall x (Fx<->Gx).:(exists x Fx<->exists x Gx)
# To enable QDISTEA, prove T209 (Ex165 T209).
## T209
QDISTEA    exists x (Fx&Gx).:exists x Fx&exists x Gx
##  
QDIST      QDISTUA1.QDISTUA2.QDISTUA1a.QDISTUA2a.QDISTUA1b.QDISTUA2b.QDISTEO1.QDISTEO2.QDISTEO1a.QDISTEO2a.QDISTEO1b.QDISTEO2b.QDISTUC.QDISTUEC.QDISTUB.QDISTUEB.QDISTEA
## Confinement Laws
## T215
CONFUA1    forall x (P&Fx).:P&forall x Fx
CONFUA2    P&forall x Fx.:forall x (P&Fx)
##  
CONFUA3    forall x (Fx&P).:forall x Fx&P
CONFUA4    forall x Fx&P.:forall x (Fx&P)
## T216
CONFEA1    exists x (P&Fx).:P&exists x Fx
CONFEA2    P&exists x Fx.:exists x (P&Fx)
##  
CONFEA3    exists x (Fx&P).:exists x Fx&P
CONFEA4    exists x Fx&P.:exists x (Fx&P)
## T217
CONFUO1    forall x (P|Fx).:P|forall x Fx
CONFUO2    P|forall x Fx.:forall x (P|Fx)
##  
CONFUO3    forall x (Fx|P).:forall x Fx|P
CONFUO4    forall x Fx|P.:forall x (Fx|P)
## T218
CONFEO1    exists x (P|Fx).:P|exists x Fx
CONFEO2    P|exists x Fx.:exists x (P|Fx)
##  
CONFEO3    exists x (Fx|P).:exists x Fx|P
CONFEO4    exists x Fx|P.:exists x (Fx|P)
## T219
CONFUCC1   forall x (P->Fx).:(P->forall x Fx)
CONFUCC2   (P->forall x Fx).:forall x (P->Fx)
## T220
CONFECC1   exists x (P->Fx).:(P->exists x Fx)
CONFECC2   (P->exists x Fx).:exists x (P->Fx)
## T221
CONFUCA1   forall x (Fx->P).:(exists x Fx->P)
CONFUCA2   (exists x Fx->P).:forall x (Fx->P)
## T222
CONFECA1   exists x (Fx->P).:(forall x Fx->P)
CONFECA2   (forall x Fx->P).:exists x (Fx->P)
## Deriv 3.224a
CONFUB1    forall x (Fx<->P).:(forall x Fx&P)|(~exists x Fx&~P)
CONFUB2    (forall x Fx&P)|(~exists x Fx&~P).:forall x (Fx<->P)
##  
CONFUB3    forall x (P<->Fx).:(P&forall x Fx)|(~P&~exists x Fx)
CONFUB4    (P&forall x Fx)|(~P&~exists x Fx).:forall x (P<->Fx)
## Deriv 3.224b
CONFEB1    exists x (Fx<->P).:(exists x Fx&P)|(~forall x Fx&~P)
CONFEB2    (exists x Fx&P)|(~forall x Fx&~P).:exists x (Fx<->P)
##  
CONFEB3    exists x (P<->Fx).:(P&exists x Fx)|(~P&~forall x Fx)
CONFEB4    (P&exists x Fx)|(~P&~forall x Fx).:exists x (P<->Fx)
##  
CONF       CONFUA1.CONFUA2.CONFUA3.CONFUA4.CONFEA1.CONFEA2.CONFEA3.CONFEA4.CONFUO1.CONFUO2.CONFUO3.CONFUO4.CONFEO1.CONFEO2.CONFEO3.CONFEO4.CONFUCC1.CONFUCC2.CONFECC1.CONFECC2.CONFUCA1.CONFUCA2.CONFECA1.CONFECA2.CONFUB1.CONFUB2.CONFUB3.CONFUB4.CONFEB1.CONFEB2.CONFEB3.CONFEB4
## Vacuous Quantification Laws
## T227
VAC1       forall x P.:P
VAC2       P.:forall x P
## T228
VAC3       exists x P.:P
VAC4       P.:exists x P
##  
VAC        VAC1.VAC2.VAC3.VAC4
## Quantifier Comutativity Laws
## T251
QCOM1      forall x forall y F(xy).:forall y forall x F(xy)
## T252
QCOM2      exists x exists y F(xy).:exists y exists x F(xy)
##  
QCOM       QCOM1.QCOM2.RT251.RT252
##  
##                          CHAPTER V
##                            IDENTITY
SId        .: A=A
LL1        A=B. FA .: FB
##                      DERIVED RULES
## Other forms of Leibniz' Law
LL2        A=B. FB .: FA
LL3        ~FA. FB .: ~A=B
LL4        FA. ~FB .: ~A=B
## T304
LL5        A=B .: FA<->FB
## 
LL         LL1.LL2.LL3.LL4.LL5
## Symmetry of Identity
## T302
Sm1        A=B .: B=A
## T312
Sm2        ~A=B .: ~B=A
## 
Sm         Sm1.Sm2
## Euclid's Law
## T305
EL         A=B .: C(A)=C(B)
## Quantifier Elimination Laws
## Deriv 5.050-5.065
QElim1E    forall z z=A  .: exists x Fx<->FA
QElim1Ea   forall z z=A. exists x Fx  .: FA
QElim1U    forall z z=A  .: forall x Fx<->FA
QElim1Ua   forall z z=A. forall x Fx  .: FA
##  
QElim2E    forall z (z=A|z=B)  .: exists x Fx<->FA|FB
QElim2Ea   forall z (z=A|z=B). exists x Fx  .: FA|FB
QElim2U    forall z (z=A|z=B)  .: forall x Fx<->FA&FB
QElim2Ua   forall z (z=A|z=B). forall x Fx  .: FA&FB
##  
QElim3E    forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C)  .: exists x Fx<->FA|FB|FC
QElim3Ea   forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C). exists x Fx  .: FA|FB|FC
QElim3U    forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C)  .: forall x Fx<->FA&FB&FC
QElim3Ua   forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C). forall x Fx  .: FA&FB&FC
##  
QElim4E    forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D)  .: exists x Fx<->FA|FB|FC|FD
QElim4Ea   forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D). exists x Fx  .: FA|FB|FC|FD
QElim4U    forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D)  .: forall x Fx<->FA&FB&FC&FD
QElim4Ua   forall z (z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D). forall x Fx  .: FA&FB&FC&FD
##  
QElim1ER   forall z (Fz<->z=A)  .: exists x (Fx&Gx)<->GA
QElim1ERa  forall z (Fz<->z=A). exists x (Fx&Gx)  .: GA
QElim1UR   forall z (Fz<->z=A)  .: forall x (Fx->Gx)<->GA
QElim1URa  forall z (Fz<->z=A). forall x (Fx->Gx)  .: GA
##  
QElim2ER   forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B)  .: exists x (Fx&Gx)<->GA|GB
QElim2ERa  forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B). exists x (Fx&Gx)  .: GA|GB
QElim2UR   forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B)  .: forall x (Fx->Gx)<->GA&GB
QElim2URa  forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B). forall x (Fx->Gx)  .: GA&GB
##  
QElim3ER   forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C)  .: exists x (Fx&Gx)<->GA|GB|GC
QElim3ERa  forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C). exists x (Fx&Gx)  .: GA|GB|GC
QElim3UR   forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C)  .: forall x (Fx->Gx)<->GA&GB&GC
QElim3URa  forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C). forall x (Fx->Gx)  .: GA&GB&GC
##  
QElim4ER   forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D)  .: exists x (Fx&Gx)<->GA|GB|GC|GD
QElim4ERa  forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D). exists x (Fx&Gx)  .: GA|GB|GC|GD
QElim4UR   forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D)  .: forall x (Fx->Gx)<->GA&GB&GC&GD
QElim4URa  forall z (Fz<->z=A|z=B|z=C|z=D). forall x (Fx->Gx)  .: GA&GB&GC&GD
##  
QElim      QElim1U.QElim1E.QElim1UR.QElim1ER.QElim2U.QElim2E.QElim2UR.QElim2ER.QElim3U.QElim3E.QElim3UR.QElim3ER.QElim4U.QElim4E.QElim4UR.QElim4ER.QElim1Ua.QElim1Ea.QElim1URa.QElim1ERa.QElim2Ua.QElim2Ea.QElim2URa.QElim2ERa.QElim3Ua.QElim3Ea.QElim3URa.QElim3ERa.QElim4Ua.QElim4Ea.QElim4URa.QElim4ERa
